WEBVTT

01:24.840 --> 01:27.880
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:35.640 --> 01:37.040
Such a lavish spread today!

01:42.240 --> 01:43.520
Please sit down first.

01:56.000 --> 01:57.040
Wipe your hands.

01:58.160 --> 01:59.440
What does Master Zheng say?

01:59.520 --> 02:00.920
This Yan family

02:01.560 --> 02:05.360
really has a deep blood feud
with the Cui and Zheng families.

02:06.960 --> 02:12.080
Back then, Cui and Zheng joined forces
to take over the Yan family,

02:12.160 --> 02:16.280
leading to their massacre
by the Black Dragon Bandits.

02:17.680 --> 02:18.880
So,

02:19.520 --> 02:21.160
do you still want to kill Yan Zijing?

02:28.360 --> 02:31.560
That's always been the way.

02:31.640 --> 02:33.720
Business is naturally bloody.

02:33.800 --> 02:35.440
Business…

02:37.960 --> 02:41.600
Over a single Red Leaf Crown,
costing my brother's life,

02:42.200 --> 02:44.240
consuming millions
from our family fortune,

02:44.320 --> 02:46.560
and being involved
in the smuggling scandal,

02:46.640 --> 02:47.960
almost couldn't escape.

02:48.040 --> 02:51.200
So, I don't believe
your father would remain unmoved.

02:51.280 --> 02:52.880
He's always been cautious.

02:54.640 --> 02:56.160
He said he's just testing the waters

02:57.080 --> 03:00.000
to see if Yan Zijing came
for the Black Dragon Bandits.

03:08.920 --> 03:09.760
Wu,

03:09.840 --> 03:11.800
if the Yan family truly was framed
and destroyed

03:11.880 --> 03:13.880
by the Cui and Zheng families,

03:14.400 --> 03:16.400
do you think Yan Zijing will let this go

03:17.480 --> 03:19.280
now that he's back in Yangzhou?

03:20.960 --> 03:24.200
The Cui family is a lesson from the past.

03:30.600 --> 03:31.880
He must die.

03:59.720 --> 04:03.080
I didn't expect Ms. Su
to actually keep your word.

04:04.560 --> 04:05.400
Count it.

04:09.280 --> 04:12.240
There is 500,000 mace, not 600,000.

04:12.840 --> 04:14.000
No need to count.

04:15.520 --> 04:19.440
I've sold off everything from Clear Mind.
I sold all the jewelry.

04:21.519 --> 04:23.640
This is all the cash we got.

04:24.520 --> 04:25.960
Not a penny more.

04:26.040 --> 04:28.760
I never compromise.

04:29.280 --> 04:33.320
What I want is 600,000 mace,
not a penny less.

04:38.520 --> 04:41.720
In partnerships, profits and losses
are always our own responsibility.

04:42.240 --> 04:44.560
No business always makes a profit.

04:45.720 --> 04:47.320
You've been in the business
longer than me.

04:47.400 --> 04:49.440
You should understand
this better than I do.

04:49.520 --> 04:52.960
What you're saying doesn't concern me,
but let me tell you,

04:53.480 --> 04:55.400
if it's even a penny short,

04:56.240 --> 05:00.080
I will make sure you will never stand
in Yangzhou again.

05:00.160 --> 05:01.720
When have I ever stood in Yangzhou?

05:03.040 --> 05:05.120
Clear Mind has been reduced to this today.

05:05.640 --> 05:07.200
Do you think I feel good about it?

05:07.280 --> 05:09.520
When all the jewelry shops
suppressed Clear Mind,

05:09.600 --> 05:10.720
what were you doing?

05:11.440 --> 05:14.000
Did you lift a finger? You didn't.

05:14.080 --> 05:15.920
How do you have the nerve
to ask me for 600,000?

05:16.000 --> 05:18.160
Who was it that made such a promise?

05:18.240 --> 05:21.880
Who turned Clear Mind into this?
How do you have the nerve to sit here?

05:22.480 --> 05:25.040
How do you have the nerve
to bargain with me?

05:34.040 --> 05:35.440
Even if you force me to death,

05:42.280 --> 05:43.640
I still have only 500,000 mace.

05:44.840 --> 05:46.120
My life's a wreck,

05:47.800 --> 05:49.280
not a penny more.

05:54.880 --> 05:57.880
Meeting someone as shameless as you,

05:58.720 --> 06:00.560
I've truly opened my eyes.

06:02.280 --> 06:03.120
Fine.

06:03.880 --> 06:05.280
I'll consider myself unlucky,

06:06.920 --> 06:08.160
but from now on,

06:08.680 --> 06:10.800
don't let me run into you
in Yangzhou again.

06:29.320 --> 06:30.280
Sorry, sir.

06:31.000 --> 06:33.560
We only sell jewelry.
We don't buy jewelry back.

06:33.640 --> 06:35.680
Sir, these shabby pieces,

06:35.760 --> 06:36.920
I'll sell them for 100,000 mace.

06:37.960 --> 06:40.800
That won't work.
I can't make that decision.

06:44.400 --> 06:45.280
How about 80,000?

06:47.360 --> 06:51.320
Sir, the rules here are strict.
I can't go against them.

06:51.920 --> 06:54.400
Perhaps you should try asking elsewhere.

06:57.880 --> 06:59.000
Take care.

07:53.760 --> 07:54.600
You ran into Yingpeng?

07:54.680 --> 07:57.400
How dare the Black Dragon Bandits
enter Yangzhou?

07:59.200 --> 08:04.200
They even dared to collude in Chang'an,
let alone Yangzhou.

08:08.920 --> 08:11.840
This is the Yan family's
glassmaking technique.

08:13.240 --> 08:14.560
Yan Family Glass?

08:15.720 --> 08:17.080
Duanwu, it's late.

08:18.920 --> 08:20.000
What are you looking at?

08:23.480 --> 08:27.960
The Persian glassware from Jubao House
is the finest in Yangzhou,

08:28.480 --> 08:29.920
worth a fortune.

08:32.240 --> 08:35.880
But their supply still depends on Persia.

08:37.159 --> 08:38.600
I was thinking,

08:39.600 --> 08:41.880
if Clear Mind could make glass,

08:43.200 --> 08:44.760
our own glass,

08:45.400 --> 08:46.760
even if it's just for accessories,

08:46.840 --> 08:47.720
even if

08:48.800 --> 08:50.520
it's just these glass hairpins,

08:50.600 --> 08:54.360
then we could break
Clear Mind's lack of foundation,

08:54.440 --> 08:55.880
and from then on,

08:56.680 --> 08:58.280
our supply
wouldn't be controlled by others.

09:00.000 --> 09:04.160
But Jubao House excels at glassmaking,
and they're the only one in Yangzhou.

09:04.240 --> 09:06.840
If we also start making glass…

09:07.560 --> 09:11.840
Duanwu, are you trying to revenge
on the Zheng family for Lady Huan's death?

09:29.880 --> 09:32.240
Clear Mind has become so bad,

09:35.840 --> 09:37.240
and I can't escape the blame.

09:39.640 --> 09:41.400
It's all because I was too hasty.

09:45.000 --> 09:46.560
A heart like a clear mirror

09:48.160 --> 09:49.680
is what helps one go far.

09:51.640 --> 09:53.840
Let me tell you why I want to make glass.

09:58.200 --> 10:00.840
This is the Yangzhou jewelry map
Mr. Zhang gave me.

10:01.480 --> 10:06.320
It includes all the techniques and jewelry
from 67 jewelry shops in Yangzhou.

10:08.240 --> 10:09.520
But look here.

10:10.320 --> 10:13.680
Before, in Yangzhou,
there were glass workshops,

10:14.200 --> 10:16.040
not just Jubao House alone.

10:18.840 --> 10:20.360
Like Qin's Glass Workshop.

10:23.480 --> 10:24.840
Mr. Qin…

10:29.200 --> 10:30.440
So…

10:31.440 --> 10:33.840
We can ask Mr. Qin to help us!

10:34.720 --> 10:37.160
If we do that,
it will be the best solution.

10:37.760 --> 10:40.120
So, you're not trying
to shut down Clear Mind,

10:40.200 --> 10:43.720
but using this opportunity
to have Zheng Wu completely withdraw.

10:43.800 --> 10:45.480
After that, there will be
no more ties with them.

10:47.240 --> 10:49.640
Duanwu, you really think ahead.

10:55.760 --> 10:59.960
But with Zheng Wu pulling out,
we're left struggling.

11:00.040 --> 11:01.920
And soon, we have to pay back

11:03.360 --> 11:05.560
Xue Liniang and the others.

11:06.480 --> 11:08.280
What do we do about their money?

11:11.320 --> 11:12.920
We will definitely repay them.

11:20.040 --> 11:21.120
First, give them the IOU.

11:21.200 --> 11:24.880
Xue Liniang and the others
are reasonable people.

11:25.520 --> 11:28.480
They've worked hard to earn that money.
That's why I am anxious.

11:30.720 --> 11:34.840
Then, this time,
we're betting everything to survive.

11:40.080 --> 11:41.440
Let's take a chance,

11:46.240 --> 11:47.800
one last chance.

12:07.080 --> 12:08.240
Go!

12:10.040 --> 12:11.280
We need them alive!

12:12.480 --> 12:13.440
There's someone in the forest. Let's go!

12:14.320 --> 12:15.200
Hurry!

12:29.520 --> 12:31.680
-It's a trap! Retreat!
-Yes!

12:41.400 --> 12:42.760
Find an exit!

13:15.880 --> 13:16.960
Protect the Master!

13:26.280 --> 13:27.880
Master! Master!

13:28.560 --> 13:29.720
Master!

13:31.160 --> 13:32.320
Master!

13:33.040 --> 13:34.200
Master!

13:43.560 --> 13:44.480
Hurry!

13:44.560 --> 13:45.480
Go!

13:46.000 --> 13:46.840
Go!

14:05.640 --> 14:06.520
Hurry! Go!

14:06.600 --> 14:07.440
Go!

14:07.520 --> 14:08.960
Hurry!

14:32.080 --> 14:33.200
Master!

14:33.280 --> 14:34.320
Go!

14:38.320 --> 14:39.680
Go! Retreat!

14:50.800 --> 14:51.960
Gee up!

14:53.640 --> 14:54.760
Gee up!

15:18.480 --> 15:20.920
Lady Shiqi! Lady Shiqi!

15:22.960 --> 15:25.400
Lady Shiqi! We're in trouble.

15:25.480 --> 15:26.880
There are traps
set all around Zhenlang Pavilion.

15:26.960 --> 15:28.440
We need to hide here for now.

15:31.720 --> 15:32.680
How did you get in?

15:32.760 --> 15:34.040
You're badly injured.
Go to the medical hall.

15:34.120 --> 15:34.960
Don't let Duanwu see you.

15:35.040 --> 15:36.040
-Help us out!
-Hurry up and get out!

15:36.120 --> 15:39.080
There are traps outside. I'm begging you.

15:39.160 --> 15:40.320
What happened, Yunxiu?

15:41.200 --> 15:42.320
Duanwu…

15:42.920 --> 15:44.160
What's going on?

15:45.720 --> 15:47.680
Duanwu!

15:48.280 --> 15:50.880
We found the Black Dragon Bandits.
It was an ambush.

15:53.280 --> 15:55.400
Now, Zhenlang Pavilion is surrounded.

15:55.480 --> 15:57.480
Can we rest here for a while?

16:01.000 --> 16:03.720
-Yunxiu, take him to the back room.
-Alright.

16:05.560 --> 16:06.640
Yunxiu, wait.

16:14.560 --> 16:15.480
Alright.

16:16.800 --> 16:17.760
Useless!

16:18.360 --> 16:19.600
How could you let him get away?

16:23.800 --> 16:25.640
It should have been a success.

16:25.720 --> 16:28.440
But who knew Yan Zijing had left people
on the outside?

16:28.520 --> 16:32.200
But although Yan Zijing escaped,
he was severely wounded.

16:34.160 --> 16:35.520
From now on,

16:36.040 --> 16:38.560
send people to watch all herbal shops
and medical halls in town.

16:39.080 --> 16:41.920
Write down anyone
who buys medicine or calls for a doctor,

16:42.440 --> 16:44.440
especially those related to Yan Zijing.

16:44.520 --> 16:45.520
Not a single person should escape notice!

16:45.600 --> 16:47.840
When I was waiting
around Zhenlang Pavilion,

16:48.360 --> 16:51.520
I saw Lady Shiqi from Clear Mind leave.

16:51.600 --> 16:53.440
It looked like she was headed
for the medical hall.

16:54.920 --> 16:55.920
Impossible.

16:56.480 --> 16:59.920
Su Muzhe and Yan Zijing
have a grudge that can't be resolved.

17:00.000 --> 17:01.800
If there's enough profit at stake,

17:03.040 --> 17:05.680
any hatred can be temporarily set aside.

17:05.760 --> 17:07.560
No matter where Yan Zijing is hiding,

17:07.640 --> 17:09.920
letting him go
is asking for endless trouble.

17:10.000 --> 17:11.359
We can't afford to waste any time.

17:13.720 --> 17:14.599
Wu,

17:15.640 --> 17:17.119
it's time to call on Mr. Xu.

17:20.640 --> 17:24.119
Now that we've made our move,
there's no turning back.

17:27.560 --> 17:28.640
Go.

17:50.160 --> 17:51.160
Use this.

17:52.280 --> 17:54.160
I'll handle it. Apply the medicine first.

18:22.120 --> 18:24.480
CLEAR MIND

18:27.680 --> 18:30.640
Mr. Xu, bandits broke into Jubao House,
killing and wounding innocents.

18:30.720 --> 18:32.320
They're suspected
to have fled to Clear Mind.

18:32.400 --> 18:33.840
Please investigate.

18:36.000 --> 18:36.920
Search!

19:23.720 --> 19:24.840
Su Muzhe,

19:25.360 --> 19:28.600
Mr. Xu is investigating the case.
Hurry up and come out to meet him!

19:43.240 --> 19:44.520
Search!

19:45.600 --> 19:46.560
What are you doing?

19:47.400 --> 19:48.280
What's going on?

19:59.200 --> 20:01.720
Nanying, You came without saying a word?

20:02.320 --> 20:06.440
In the middle of the night,
what are you doing at Clear Mind?

20:06.520 --> 20:08.240
We are all men.

20:09.720 --> 20:11.360
What do you think I'm doing here?

20:12.880 --> 20:14.200
But what about you?

20:14.760 --> 20:17.520
Bringing so many soldiers,
looking into a case?

20:17.600 --> 20:20.520
Today, Jubao House
was attacked by bandits,

20:20.600 --> 20:21.800
and there were many casualties.

20:22.480 --> 20:25.160
The Governor's office is carrying out
a city-wide manhunt.

20:25.680 --> 20:29.920
There's word that the bandits
might be hiding in Clear Mind.

20:32.000 --> 20:34.120
That's why I came to search.

20:35.200 --> 20:36.920
Nanying, what are you talking about?

20:38.560 --> 20:40.680
Yangzhou has always been peaceful.

20:41.480 --> 20:43.080
How could there be bandits here,

20:44.520 --> 20:46.240
killing so many people?

20:47.440 --> 20:49.280
This matter
must be thoroughly investigated!

20:50.400 --> 20:54.480
I, too, must fulfill my duty as Inspector.
I'll report it to the court.

21:02.800 --> 21:07.320
A few bandits are not worth
troubling the Emperor over.

21:09.040 --> 21:10.880
-Search!
-Nanying!

21:14.320 --> 21:15.880
Nanying, wait…

21:20.680 --> 21:22.960
Oh, what's going on?

21:23.480 --> 21:24.400
Muzhe.

21:26.080 --> 21:28.840
You're suffering from such severe chills.
Why are you out here?

21:31.600 --> 21:32.560
Well…

21:33.800 --> 21:36.920
Greetings, Mr. Xu. Greetings, Mr. Wu.

21:37.440 --> 21:40.120
What happened at Clear Mind?
Why are there so many people here?

21:41.080 --> 21:43.800
Just now, Mr. Xu said
bandits broke into Jubao House

21:43.880 --> 21:45.440
and killed quite a few people.

21:45.960 --> 21:48.200
He said the suspects
fled to our Clear Mind.

21:48.280 --> 21:50.040
So, he brought soldiers to search.

21:50.680 --> 21:51.840
Jubao House…

21:53.400 --> 21:55.040
They fled to my Clear Mind?

21:57.640 --> 21:59.240
Oh, they're at Clear Mind…

21:59.840 --> 22:01.880
If they are here,

22:08.280 --> 22:11.920
then, Mr. Xu, please search.

22:12.000 --> 22:13.880
A search will help us feel at ease.

22:14.400 --> 22:15.240
Yes, Nanying.

22:15.320 --> 22:16.880
Why haven't you
even put your clothes on properly?

22:22.600 --> 22:23.800
Carry on with your search.

22:26.040 --> 22:27.160
Jinran,

22:28.040 --> 22:30.880
you're now the Inspector of Huainandao.

22:30.960 --> 22:33.600
You serve the imperial court.
Your health is important.

22:33.680 --> 22:36.080
Look at you, working day and night.

22:36.160 --> 22:37.840
It's getting late.

22:38.360 --> 22:41.640
Then, I won't bother you further.

22:43.160 --> 22:45.160
Won't you search?

22:46.480 --> 22:48.560
Ms. Su, you don't seem to be feeling well.

22:49.160 --> 22:53.360
In a couple of days, I'll have someone
bring over some medicinal prescriptions

22:54.880 --> 22:57.240
-Thank you for looking after me, Mr. Xu.
-Thank you.

22:57.880 --> 22:59.120
I have some urgent matters to attend to.

22:59.200 --> 23:01.320
-Farewell.
-Take care.

23:04.320 --> 23:06.320
-Let's search somewhere else!
-Yes, sir!

23:07.480 --> 23:08.440
Retreat!

23:09.160 --> 23:10.760
Mr. Xu, we…

23:12.840 --> 23:14.840
Come by often, Mr. Xu!

23:21.440 --> 23:24.280
Zheng Wu,
would you like to stay for a while?

23:25.480 --> 23:26.960
Your performance today

23:28.120 --> 23:29.240
was really impressive.

23:30.960 --> 23:33.680
Mr. Zheng, rest up early.

23:39.920 --> 23:42.080
Let me escort you back. It's cold outside.

23:49.840 --> 23:52.760
-Take care.
-Mr. Xu, please wait!

23:54.280 --> 23:55.280
Mr. Xu…

23:57.320 --> 24:00.720
Yan Zijing must be here at Clear Mind.

24:01.920 --> 24:04.440
Who ordered you to kill Yan Zijing?

24:05.120 --> 24:07.000
Now you've made such a big scene.

24:07.080 --> 24:09.680
Am I someone the Zheng family can command?

24:12.080 --> 24:13.000
Mr. Xu,

24:13.080 --> 24:16.520
you and the Zheng family
both serve under Prince Ying's command,

24:16.600 --> 24:19.880
Helping each other is only natural.

24:22.600 --> 24:25.560
From now on, you need to think
things through more carefully.

24:26.480 --> 24:29.680
There aren't many young men
left in the Zheng family.

24:32.040 --> 24:32.880
Retreat!

24:32.960 --> 24:34.880
I'll follow Mr. Xu's advice!

24:44.760 --> 24:45.680
Everyone's gone.

24:57.920 --> 24:59.280
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

25:00.520 --> 25:04.000
You called me here today
just to help Yan Zijing?

25:07.720 --> 25:09.960
He found the Black Dragon Bandits
on the outskirts of Yangzhou.

25:11.160 --> 25:14.320
The Black Dragon Bandits injured him.
I have no reason not to save him.

25:15.440 --> 25:17.600
You're just giving yourself
a reason to save him.

25:23.040 --> 25:24.640
I'm not trying to dig into your wounds.

25:25.560 --> 25:27.640
What happened when you both
set off from Langhuan Dockyard?

25:28.240 --> 25:29.920
What happened after that?

25:31.680 --> 25:34.120
What happened when your convoy
was ambushed?

25:34.200 --> 25:36.080
Why did you and Yan Zijing

25:37.400 --> 25:38.640
fall out?

25:46.040 --> 25:47.760
Back then, I made an agreement
with Yan Zijing

25:48.800 --> 25:50.440
to meet at Piti Spring.

25:51.720 --> 25:53.080
He would lure out
the Black Dragon Bandits,

25:53.600 --> 25:55.040
and I would lead my men to eliminate them.

25:55.120 --> 25:56.760
But when I arrived,

26:00.160 --> 26:01.560
I didn't find any of you.

26:03.160 --> 26:04.400
Later, I heard

26:04.480 --> 26:06.120
that near Langhuan Dockyard,

26:06.640 --> 26:08.240
the Black Dragon Bandits
had ambushed your convoy.

26:08.320 --> 26:09.920
But when I got there,

26:12.600 --> 26:14.320
the place was covered with bodies.

26:18.360 --> 26:20.360
I even saw that among Yan Zijing's guards,

26:21.520 --> 26:24.320
there were our native people
and also Sogdians.

26:24.920 --> 26:27.160
You must have recruited warriors
and were about to leave.

26:27.680 --> 26:28.720
Mr. Zhang,

26:30.680 --> 26:31.840
back then…

26:38.080 --> 26:40.920
Wait. Did you just mention
there were Sogdians?

26:43.720 --> 26:46.160
There were no Sogdians in the convoy.

26:46.240 --> 26:48.920
That's impossible.
I saw it with my own eyes.

26:54.760 --> 26:56.440
Could it be that the Black Dragon Bandits

26:58.240 --> 27:00.360
disguised themselves as guards
and infiltrated the convoy,

27:02.040 --> 27:02.880
planning to do something sinister?

27:04.880 --> 27:07.520
Duanwu, the convoy guards want to kill us!

27:07.600 --> 27:08.840
Run!

27:16.280 --> 27:17.600
Run, Duanwu!

27:18.280 --> 27:20.320
-Shrimp!
-The convoy guards want to kill us!

27:31.920 --> 27:32.880
They've all left?

27:32.960 --> 27:34.600
Why would there be Sogdians in the convoy?

27:37.880 --> 27:40.200
-I don't know.
-Supervisor Kang,

27:42.040 --> 27:43.840
I've never hidden anything from you.

27:47.880 --> 27:49.600
I just want to know

27:51.480 --> 27:53.480
what exactly happened in the desert.

27:55.960 --> 27:57.920
So many people died in the desert.

28:18.320 --> 28:20.680
We were fully prepared.

28:23.720 --> 28:25.920
We meant to use the convoy
to lure out the Black Dragon Bandits,

28:26.000 --> 28:27.840
but who would have thought

28:28.520 --> 28:30.600
that they would cross the border,

28:30.680 --> 28:32.560
disguise themselves
as our guards, and ambush us?

28:37.160 --> 28:39.760
Do you know why Yan Zijing
shot that arrow at you?

28:44.400 --> 28:47.440
Because at that moment,
Li Kui's arrow was already aimed at you.

28:49.320 --> 28:51.760
In a split second, he had no other choice.

28:58.120 --> 29:00.800
He didn't want you to know
that it was the Black Dragon Bandits,

29:01.400 --> 29:06.200
that it was Li Kui who killed Shrimp,
killed Cao Da,

29:06.280 --> 29:08.640
and killed everyone in the convoy.

29:18.800 --> 29:20.160
If you had known…

29:27.600 --> 29:29.160
what would you have done?

29:31.680 --> 29:35.640
If you had known,
would you still be the same Su Muzhe now?

29:37.400 --> 29:40.360
If we hadn't kept this from you,
what would you have done?

29:40.880 --> 29:44.080
That's something Yan Zijing himself
may never achieve in this life.

29:45.200 --> 29:48.160
How could he possibly let you do it alone?

29:51.240 --> 29:53.880
He threw you away at Langhuan Dockyard

29:56.520 --> 29:58.360
because he wanted to protect you.

29:59.600 --> 30:02.040
He didn't want you to fall into danger.

30:02.880 --> 30:05.080
He'd rather you hate him.

30:06.080 --> 30:08.520
At least, he'd never hurt you.

30:11.280 --> 30:13.120
I've always been by his side,

30:18.560 --> 30:21.120
and I know how much pain he's in.

30:24.400 --> 30:26.040
But you've never known

30:26.920 --> 30:29.680
that hating you hurts more
than hating the Black Dragon Bandits.

30:31.000 --> 30:32.800
Why did you make decisions for me?

30:34.040 --> 30:35.920
Did you never believe in me,

30:37.280 --> 30:39.640
or did you never believe in yourself?

30:56.480 --> 30:57.560
Foolish!

30:59.600 --> 31:00.840
Who told you to do this?

31:00.920 --> 31:03.840
How are you acting so impulsively,
like Zheng Si?

31:03.920 --> 31:07.680
If he truly is a remnant of
the Yan family, shouldn't we make a move?

31:07.760 --> 31:09.760
Originally, we could have dealt
with him in secret,

31:09.840 --> 31:11.440
but now you've exposed
the entire Zheng family!

31:12.400 --> 31:13.520
So what?

31:14.280 --> 31:15.400
Father,

31:16.400 --> 31:19.520
since he's an enemy of the Zheng family,
just kill him!

31:23.560 --> 31:25.480
We must kill him, of course.

31:26.000 --> 31:29.400
Those who are already in the ground
should be wiped out completely.

31:30.640 --> 31:32.840
But Zheng Wu, remember this.

31:33.400 --> 31:37.080
Never let the Zheng family be harmed!

31:41.160 --> 31:42.480
I understand.

32:27.280 --> 32:28.320
Be careful!

32:32.120 --> 32:33.040
Thank you.

32:37.960 --> 32:39.440
How did I end up here?

32:40.240 --> 32:41.160
Where is Kang Ju?

32:42.600 --> 32:44.240
The wound has been treated.

32:47.960 --> 32:48.960
I'll go heat the medicine.

32:49.680 --> 32:50.840
Wait a moment.

33:03.000 --> 33:03.880
Why are you saving me?

33:17.760 --> 33:19.640
Don't you have something to say to me?

33:37.680 --> 33:38.640
Thank you.

33:50.240 --> 33:51.120
That's all?

34:05.920 --> 34:06.880
Don't worry.

34:07.840 --> 34:10.920
Once I'm healed,
I'll leave Clear Mind immediately.

34:30.880 --> 34:32.719
Just stay at Clear Mind.

34:34.000 --> 34:35.159
It's safe here.

34:48.239 --> 34:49.199
How is it?

34:59.800 --> 35:00.800
The same.

35:03.040 --> 35:04.320
I'm the same as him.

35:06.400 --> 35:08.520
I can be abandoned just like Zheng Si.

35:10.920 --> 35:12.160
What's wrong?

35:12.720 --> 35:14.280
Have you found Yan Zijing?

35:14.360 --> 35:15.680
Is he dead?

35:20.440 --> 35:21.680
No.

35:38.520 --> 35:40.920
What are you doing?

35:41.960 --> 35:43.000
Hey…

35:45.200 --> 35:46.360
Are you crazy?

35:46.440 --> 35:48.640
What fine designs!
Why are you burning them?

35:53.320 --> 35:55.200
What do you mean by this, Cui Shijiu?

35:55.280 --> 35:57.120
Just because I didn't manage
to kill Yan Zijing?

35:58.040 --> 35:59.640
Is he that important to you?

35:59.720 --> 36:02.600
-Were you with me just to kill Yan Zijing?
-Yes.

36:08.320 --> 36:10.040
-Mr. Wu.
-What?

36:14.800 --> 36:15.680
Bai Niao's invitation.

36:30.640 --> 36:33.840
Lady Shiqi, hurry
and go after Fifth Young Master!

36:34.360 --> 36:36.080
The Cui family is already gone.

36:36.160 --> 36:39.600
If you anger him,
what will you do in the future?

36:40.920 --> 36:44.480
The Cui family is gone,
and Father is dead.

36:45.520 --> 36:48.280
Yan Zijing is the one who started it all.

36:56.240 --> 36:58.760
But Zheng Wu isn't innocent either.

37:00.040 --> 37:00.960
He's the one who stole

37:01.040 --> 37:03.920
the Pearl Lotus Terrace
the Cui family worked so hard on.

37:05.000 --> 37:08.160
He's the one who destroyed
the last pillar of the Cui family.

37:09.160 --> 37:12.200
Does he think I've forgotten?

37:13.280 --> 37:17.040
But before,
didn't you desperately help him?

37:17.120 --> 37:18.320
Of course, I had to help.

37:19.080 --> 37:22.840
Without him, how could I
take revenge on Yan Zijing?

37:26.320 --> 37:27.320
You see,

37:27.920 --> 37:32.320
he doesn't care at all
about me from the ruined Cui family.

37:33.880 --> 37:34.960
He knows

37:36.840 --> 37:39.800
that without him,
I can't survive in Yangzhou.

37:40.720 --> 37:42.200
But he also knows

37:44.440 --> 37:46.080
that for him and me,

37:47.040 --> 37:50.640
it's all just mutual use,
a game of pretense.

37:51.160 --> 37:55.920
CLEAR MIND

38:05.160 --> 38:06.120
How did it go?

38:08.640 --> 38:10.080
What did you say to Duanwu?

38:13.240 --> 38:14.880
I… I didn't say anything.

38:18.280 --> 38:20.040
We have a prisoner alive.
I'll interrogate him.

38:20.120 --> 38:21.080
Come back!

38:27.400 --> 38:28.520
What did you really say to her?

38:29.640 --> 38:30.880
I told her

38:30.960 --> 38:32.720
that Shrimp and the others' deaths
have nothing to do with you.

38:33.320 --> 38:34.240
Oh…

38:38.640 --> 38:39.960
Why did you tell her that?

38:40.040 --> 38:42.040
Zhang Jinran has already found

38:42.120 --> 38:44.160
that the Black Dragon Bandits
infiltrated our convoy,

38:44.240 --> 38:45.720
and he's already told Duanwu.

38:46.240 --> 38:47.440
How could I hide it?

38:49.080 --> 38:51.640
Duanwu is no longer
the pearl diver from before.

38:51.720 --> 38:53.440
She will have her own choices.

38:53.960 --> 38:55.120
You saw it yourself.

38:55.200 --> 38:58.400
Although she hates you,
she can't let go of you in the end.

38:58.480 --> 39:01.760
You can't let her live her life
with that hatred toward you forever.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.040
Don't take it too much to heart.

39:06.640 --> 39:08.160
She's already let go.

39:08.680 --> 39:10.000
Why can't you?

39:26.480 --> 39:27.440
What's up?

39:27.960 --> 39:28.880
Ms. Su,

39:29.480 --> 39:31.640
last night, Yan Zijing
was severely injured.

39:33.720 --> 39:34.960
What happened?

39:35.480 --> 39:37.080
What happened isn't important.

39:37.160 --> 39:38.480
What matters

39:38.560 --> 39:40.840
is that we don't know
where Yan Zijing is hiding now.

39:41.360 --> 39:42.680
I'll ask you just one thing.

39:43.240 --> 39:44.920
Are you willing to join forces
with me to draw him out?

39:45.000 --> 39:46.040
Not willing.

39:46.120 --> 39:49.880
The smuggling case
almost ruined Clear Mind for good.

39:51.680 --> 39:55.440
Last night, Mr. Xu came
and searched Clear Mind.

39:55.960 --> 39:57.800
It must be related to this case.

39:58.680 --> 40:00.080
I don't want to get involved.

40:00.600 --> 40:03.080
I advise you not to either.

40:03.160 --> 40:04.520
Su Muzhe,

40:05.680 --> 40:06.640
are you afraid now?

40:06.720 --> 40:07.880
Have you forgotten the reason
you came to Yangzhou?

40:07.960 --> 40:09.080
Yes, I'm afraid.

40:11.800 --> 40:13.000
Cui Shijiu,

40:14.400 --> 40:16.480
you're different from the Cui family.

40:17.480 --> 40:19.680
Don't let revenge cloud your judgment.

40:19.760 --> 40:21.240
Don't trap yourself in it and get stuck.

40:25.560 --> 40:27.080
Su Muzhe,

40:28.800 --> 40:29.880
do you still hate him?

40:40.800 --> 40:41.640
I see.

40:47.600 --> 40:49.960
Thank you, Mr. Zhang,
for saving me yesterday.

40:50.040 --> 40:51.040
It's alright.

40:51.640 --> 40:53.320
There's no need to say that between us.

40:54.520 --> 40:56.120
How did this happen?

40:57.160 --> 40:58.680
What exactly are you investigating?

41:00.240 --> 41:04.080
The century-old Zheng family,
colluding with the Black Dragon Bandits,

41:04.600 --> 41:08.360
openly smuggling in Yangzhou…
Who's supporting them behind the scenes?

41:10.320 --> 41:13.480
After the incident, the Governor's office
hastily closed the case,

41:13.560 --> 41:16.760
pinning the blame
on the now-destroyed Cui family.

41:17.280 --> 41:19.160
Who's behind this?

41:20.000 --> 41:21.200
What do you think I'm investigating?

41:24.360 --> 41:26.000
Are you trying to say

41:27.320 --> 41:28.880
that behind the Zheng family

41:30.280 --> 41:31.120
is Prince Ying?

41:34.320 --> 41:36.160
Since you figure out this,

41:37.360 --> 41:39.280
are you planning to change your course

41:40.400 --> 41:42.280
or stick to your original purpose?

41:48.080 --> 41:49.440
In this life,

41:50.400 --> 41:52.040
I believe only in the law and justice.

41:54.240 --> 41:55.360
I wonder

41:57.080 --> 41:58.240
if you believe in me.

42:25.920 --> 42:27.800
CAO DA'S MEMORIAL TABLET
SHRIMP'S MEMORIAL TABLET

42:27.880 --> 42:30.120
LOUD'S MEMORIAL TABLET
WEI YAN'S MEMORIAL TABLET

42:30.200 --> 42:31.760
Why are you up?

42:34.480 --> 42:35.760
I'm already feeling much better.
